@startuml
title Implemented document state machine
[*] --> awaiting_upload : POST metadata
awaiting_upload --> awaiting_upload : invalid bytes / upload rejected
awaiting_upload --> quarantined : bytes stored + generation committed
quarantined --> quarantined : scanner failure / stale definitions / retry
quarantined --> clean : clean scan + promote + DB commit
quarantined --> rejected : malware found
clean --> clean : authorised generation-pinned download
note right of clean
 No public clean-status mutation.
 No delete endpoint in starter.
 Retention/legal-hold deletion is planned.
end note
@enduml
